    "Name": "Sentinel STN-6EX",
    "Details": "The Sentinel STN-6EX is a further upgrade of the STN-6E, replacing its Blazer with an ER Large Laser, and the Medium Lasers with ER variants. The C3 Slave has been exchanged for another double heat sink to handle the increased heat generation from the lasers slightly better. In an attempt to increase the survivability of the 'Mech, the XL engine has been replaced by a standard, which was made possible by using Ferro-Fibrous armor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
